{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tasks/a-helper-cut-short-leaves-the-task-to-its-worker-that-owes-a-result",
  "title": "In a delegated room another agent is shared into, that agent's turns cut short on each prompt are its own: the delegated worker owing a result is re-prompted and the task completes with what it submitted, whether a transport is shared into the child room or not",
  "rules": [
    "§23.3 step 6",
    "§6.4"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/tasks/test_worker_cut_short.py::test_a_cut_helper_leaves_a_worker_that_owes_its_result[transport], [trace]; core/mixins/_child_execution.py _collect_answer (the end is the delegated agent's alone, RMK-834), _run_with_structured_result. helper answers each of the child room's prompts (the task, then the re-prompt) with a message its turn's record says ended max_rounds, for the transport alone, so that worker is never handed it: Python's helper is an agent looping past its round cap, whose narration the worker would answer. worker answers in text, is re-prompted, submits, then says it sent it.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "email",
        "type": "email",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "worker",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Working on it."
            },
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "s",
                  "name": "submit_result",
                  "arguments": {
                    "status": "completed",
                    "summary": "Found it.",
                    "data": {
                      "x": 1
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Sent."
            },
            {
              "text": "Working on it."
            },
            {
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "s",
                  "name": "submit_result",
                  "arguments": {
                    "status": "completed",
                    "summary": "Found it.",
                    "data": {
                      "x": 1
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Sent."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "helper",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "source_channel_id": "system"
            },
            "repeat": true,
            "respond": [
              {
                "visibility": "transport",
                "content": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "body": "Still checking."
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "loop_end_reason": "max_rounds"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "parent",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "email"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "helper",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "task": "Find it.",
      "share_channels": [
        "helper",
        "email"
      ],
      "wait": true,
      "require_structured_result": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "completed",
          "result": {
            "status": "completed",
            "output": "{\"status\": \"completed\", \"summary\": \"Found it.\", \"data\": {\"x\": 1}, \"deliverables\": [], \"reason\": \"\"}",
            "error": null
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "task": "Find it.",
      "share_channels": [
        "helper"
      ],
      "wait": true,
      "require_structured_result": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "completed",
          "result": {
            "status": "completed",
            "output": "{\"status\": \"completed\", \"summary\": \"Found it.\", \"data\": {\"x\": 1}, \"deliverables\": [], \"reason\": \"\"}",
            "error": null
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "$r1": [
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "system"
          },
          "type": "message",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Find it."
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "helper"
          },
          "type": "message",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Still checking."
          },
          "metadata": {
            "loop_end_reason": "max_rounds"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "worker"
          },
          "type": "message",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Working on it."
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "system"
          },
          "type": "message",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": {
              "$contains": "submit_result"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "helper"
          },
          "type": "message",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Still checking."
          },
          "metadata": {
            "loop_end_reason": "max_rounds"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "worker"
          },
          "type": "tool_call_start"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "worker"
          },
          "type": "tool_call_end"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "worker"
          },
          "type": "message",
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Sent."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
